"url":"/docs/components/drawer#default","content":"Use `<DrawerTrigger>` to wrap a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`. The drawer opens when the trigger is pressed."},"376":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#bottom-sheet","content":"Use `placement=\"bottom\"` with controlled state for a bottom sheet pattern. Compose a\n`CloseButton` for the dismiss affordance."},"377":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#placements","content":"The drawer slides in from whichever edge you set with `placement`."},"378":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#nested-popover","content":"Popovers rendered inside a drawer stay open without dismissing the drawer."},"379":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-22","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#no-escape-dismiss","content":"Use `isKeyboardDismissDisabled` to prevent the drawer from being dismissed by the escape key."},"380":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-23","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#scrollable-content","content":"When the content is taller than the drawer, the `Content` region scrolls while the title row\nstays pinned."},"381":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-24","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Key"},"382":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-25","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Action"},"383":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-26","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Escape`"},"384":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-27","page_id":"/docs/components/dr