redDocs":[[1334,"—"],[1343,"—"],[1349,"—"],[420,"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."],[421,"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."],[1280,"**`ButtonGroup`** - a cluster of related actions (a wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`). Overlay parents like `Modal` adopt it with end alignment and padding."],[1277,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[242,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1279,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1281,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1278,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[571,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[570,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[578,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[579,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[577,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1523,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the