up\"` on the container"],[1193,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1625,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"],[1624,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"],[771,"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."],[1468,"`size` picks a step on the component's own ramp (`xs` to `2xl`) and changes only the font size."],[1511,"`size` sets every part, each on its own role ramp. Without it, the lockup follows the size\nscope."],[893,"`size` sets the label, input, and steppers. Without it, the field follows the surrounding size\nscope."],[1562,"`size` sets the label, input, description, and any control composed inside. Without it, the\nfield follows the surrounding size scope."],[513,"`size` sets the label, trigger, and calendar. Without it, the picker follows the surrounding\nsize scope."],[851,"`size` sets the modal's text, controls, and spacing. Without it, the modal follows the size\nscope around its trigger."],[469,"`slot=\"title\"` inside a `Modal` or `Dialog` sets the accessible name, and takes the overlay's\ntitle tier, one step above the heading tier."],[1924,"`sm` - Small spacing"],[1250,"`sm`, `md`, or `lg` for the adopted components inside (listed below): their text, controls, and\ndefault spacing."],[46,"`Space` / `Enter`"],[1354,"`Space` toggles the switch when it has focus"],[1006,"`status` is independent of timeline and only controls the status icon and (for `error`) the accent bar color."],[44,"`Tab`"],[385,"`Tab`"],[414,"`Tab`"],[685,"`Tab`"],[855,"`Tab`"],[1671,"`Tab`"],[1401,"`Tab`: `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."],[1398,"`TabList` must be rendered inside `Tabs` and must provide `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. Give each `Tab` 